mizdra's blog","service_icon":"https://www.mizdra.net/icon/touch","from_url":"https://www.mizdra.net/entry/2021/05/03/000139","original_url":"https://www.mizdra.net/entry/2021/05/03/000139"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zheYz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2550860e-60be-4eb4-a35a-21ed09e6c172","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これ超便利では？\n\u003chttps://blog.pastak.net/entry/2021/05/03/011623\u003e","ts":"1620018117.008100","attachments":[{"fallback":"ぱすたけ日記: Chrome Devtoolのmonitorを使うと関数の呼び出しを観察できて便利 - ぱすたけ日記","id":1,"title":"Chrome Devtoolのmonitorを使うと関数の呼び出しを観察できて便利 - ぱすたけ日記","title_link":"https://blog.pastak.net/entry/2021/05/03/011623","text":"を読んで思い出したのでご紹介です。 元の記事と同様に以下の関数 sum について、 function sum(nums, acc = 0) { console.log({ nums, acc }); if (nums.length === 0) return 0; if (nums.length === 1) return nums[0]; return sum(nums.slice(1), acc + nums[0]); } この関数sumの引数 (nums と acc) の呼び出しごとの変化を見たい場合は、所謂プリントデバッグや debugger を使うのは一般的なテクニックとしてよく知ら…","image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/216d659c2f2bf950c3a9c2a961c60d45.png","blocks":null,"ts":1619972183,"service_name":"ぱすたけ日記","service_icon":"https://blog.pastak.net/icon/touch","from_url":"https://blog.pastak.net/entry/2021/05/03/011623","original_url":"https://blog.pastak.net/entry/2021/05/03/011623"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFP0GQZ4K"]},{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U016XJSPYD8"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07654aad-9275-4188-8338-7fc1d003f92e","type":"message","user":"U016XJSPYD8","text":"wasmがやっているのは計算とDOM操作だけですね\nあ、てことは全部wasmでできるのか","ts":"1620016115.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QqC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"387c92ff-1983-4282-b697-82a79c46c1ea","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"wasmからそこまでできるのか:hee:","ts":"1620016064.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5b7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1ca4788-2d16-4889-a001-81a9bd350179","type":"message","user":"U016XJSPYD8","text":"Deno+TSX+WebAssemblyのあわせ技でweb serverを立てるscript作ってみた\n\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/deno-ja/最速でWeb_Assemblyを使ったweb_pageを試す\u003e\nRustﾅﾆﾓﾜｶﾗﾅｲのでsample codeそのままになってます。面白い遊び方思いついたつよつよRusterの方がいらっしゃいましたらなんか書き換えてみてください","ts":"1620015874.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01ASHBSD9V","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wDvRm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5240df64-2f9e-4ace-b7f7-e45c5499dc9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"dataが取り出したい型 or undefinedになっていて、undefinedをExcludeしたら後ろで任意のプロパティ取り出せる感じになっていて","ts":"1619969353.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iwj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9e615ee-6f14-48b2-aa63-a8c93b89af0e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自動生成された型についてなんですけど、中からプロパティの型を取り出すときに毎回\n```type A = Exclude\u0026lt;AQueryResult[\"data\"], undefined\u0026gt;[\"a\"]\ntype B = Exclude\u0026lt;BQueryResult[\"data\"], undefined\u0026gt;[\"b\"]```\nみたいにしないといけなくなってて、これって自分で型書いて綺麗に整理することってできそうか分かります？\n```type A = Foo\u0026lt;AQueryResult, \"a\"\u0026gt;```\nみたいに取り出せると理想っぽい気がする","ts":"1619969277.001300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1619969452.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTNO"}]}]
